  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-responsive Climate-smart Agriculture and Food systems in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To demonstrate the use of climate smart technologies and promote their adoption in by producers and processors in agriculture value chains.

To influence the institutional governance of agriculture development programmes at regional and national levels

To develop knowledge products including policy briefs on inclusive, gender-response for climate resilient value chains in selected Caribbean countries.</narrative>
  </description>
